    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10396" root="خرف" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَرْفَى</span></b>  The <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جلبان</span>, (i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُلُبَّان</span>, or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُلْبَان</span>, &amp;c.,
accord. to different copies of the K, [see art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جلب</span>,]) <i>a well-known grain</i> or <i>seed,</i> (AHn, K,)
<i>of the kind called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَطَانِىّ</span> [i. e. <i>pulse</i>]: (AHn:)
an arabicized word, from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَرْبَى</span>, (AHn, K,) which
is Persian; also called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُلَّرٌ</span>. (AHn.)

